{"id": "2151d670-9f02-4f8e-abfb-79f0df2b9e51", "slug": "omnigrid-framework", "title": "OmniGrid Framework", "description": "Omnigrid Framework UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"OmniGrid Framework\"\ndescription: \"Omnigrid Framework UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FACC15\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#F96316\"\n  background: \"#F96316\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# OmniGrid Framework\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 6; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, security, charts, input, validation, animated, webgl, threejs.\n## Overview\nOmnigrid Framework UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nGLOBAL ROUTING OmniGrid Architecture Modules Security Access Portal 99.9% Availability 500+ Active Clusters Packet Latency <5ms Secure Matrix Framework Synchronize Global Data Networks Deploy advanced telemetry nodes to…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Synchronize Global Data Networks.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FACC15, secondary #000000, accent #F96316, background #F96316, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>OmniGrid Framework</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#f96316] text-black font-sans antialiased selection:bg-black selection:text-[#facc15] h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative\">\n\n    <!-- Background Giant Typography -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full text-center pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-overlay opacity-20 flex flex-col justify-center items-center h-full\">\n        <span class=\"text-[20vw] font-medium tracking-tighter uppercase leading-[0.8] text-black block\">GLOBAL</span>\n        <span class=\"text-[20vw] font-medium tracking-tighter uppercase leading-[0.8] text-black block ml-[10vw]\">ROUTING</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Technical Intersection Lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-6 md:left-10 w-[1px] bg-black/20 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-6 md:right-10 w-[1px] bg-black/20 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-6 md:top-10 h-[1px] bg-black/20 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-6 md:bottom-10 h-[1px] bg-black/20 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Technical Nodes (Corners) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-6 md:top-10 left-6 md:left-10 w-2 h-2 border border-black bg-[#facc15] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-6 md:top-10 right-6 md:right-10 w-2 h-2 border border-black bg-[#facc15] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 md:bottom-10 left-6 md:left-10 w-2 h-2 border border-black bg-[#facc15] -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 z-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 md:bottom-10 right-6 md:right-10 w-2 h-2 border border-black bg-[#facc15] translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 z-30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- 3D WebGL Canvas Layer -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-10 pointer-events-auto\" id=\"canvas-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Floating Top Navigation -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-6 md:top-10 left-6 right-6 md:left-10 md:right-10 z-40 pointer-events-none flex justify-center\">\n        <header class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch border border-black bg-white pointer-events-auto shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\">\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-auto p-4 md:px-8 md:border-r border-black flex items-center justify-center bg-black text-white\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-medium uppercase\">OmniGrid</span>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"flex-1 flex justify-center py-3 md:py-0 space-x-6 md:space-x-12 w-full md:w-auto border-b md:border-b-0 border-black items-center\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black hover:text-[#f96316] transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black hover:text-[#f96316] transition-colors\">Modules</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black hover:text-[#f96316] transition-colors\">Security</a>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-auto md:border-l border-black flex justify-center md:justify-end\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full md:w-auto bg-[#facc15] hover:bg-black hover:text-[#facc15] text-black text-xs font-medium py-4 px-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    Access Portal <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center Left: Stats & Logos Matrix -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-6 md:left-10 -translate-y-1/2 w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[35%] lg:w-[25%] flex flex-col gap-6 pointer-events-auto z-40\">\n\n        <!-- Client Logos -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-black p-5 flex items-center justify-between shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:aws\" width=\"36\" class=\"grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:vercel\" width=\"64\" class=\"grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"logos:cloudflare\" width=\"76\" class=\"grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Brutalist Stats -->\n        <div class=\"border border-black grid grid-cols-2 gap-[1px] bg-black p-[1px] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#facc15] p-5 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                <span class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-1 leading-none\">99.9%</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black/70 mt-1\">Availability</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#facc15] p-5 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                <span class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-1 leading-none\">500+</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black/70 mt-1\">Active Clusters</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#facc15] p-5 col-span-2 flex flex-row items-center justify-between\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-black/70\">Packet Latency</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black leading-none\">&lt;5ms</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Right: Hero Text Block -->\n    <div id=\"hero-text-block\" class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 md:bottom-10 md:right-10 w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[50%] lg:w-[40%] bg-white border border-black p-8 md:p-12 pointer-events-auto shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex flex-col z-40\">\n        <!-- Decorative corner pattern -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 border-l border-b border-black flex items-start justify-end p-2 bg-neutral-100 overflow-hidden\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent, transparent 2px, #000 2px, #000 3px);\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"inline-block bg-black text-white text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2 mb-8 w-max border border-black font-medium\">\n            Secure Matrix Framework\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight uppercase leading-[0.85] text-black mb-6\">\n            <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">Synchronize</span></span><br/>\n            <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">Global</span></span><br/>\n            <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0 text-[#f96316]\">Data</span></span>\n            <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">Networks</span></span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-black/80 mb-10 max-w-md leading-relaxed font-light\">\n            Deploy advanced telemetry nodes to aggregate, filter, and distribute real-time packets across decentralized infrastructure.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-auto\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-transparent border border-black hover:bg-black hover:text-white text-black text-xs font-medium py-4 px-8 text-center transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest flex-1\">\n                View Schema\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-black hover:bg-neutral-800 text-white text-xs font-medium py-4 px-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest flex-1\">\n                Initialize Core <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Masked Reveal Animation utilizing ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: '#hero-text-block',\n                start: 'top 95%', // Activates smoothly as the layout mounts\n            },\n            y: \"0%\",\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 0.9,\n            stagger: 0.15,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        // Subdued 3D Kinetic Object Initialization\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        const aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n        const d = 5;\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-d * aspect, d * aspect, d, -d, 1, 1000);\n\n        // Centered camera for full-viewport balance\n        camera.position.set(15, 20, 25);\n        camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        const group = new THREE.Group();\n        // Perfectly centered\n        group.position.set(0, 0, 0);\n\n        const geometry = new THREE.BoxGeometry(1.2, 1.2, 1.2);\n        const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry);\n\n        const lineMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x000000,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.85,\n            linewidth: 1\n        });\n\n        const accentMaterial1 = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xfacc15 });\n        const accentMaterial2 = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xffffff });\n\n        // Generate abstract cluster\n        for(let x=-2; x<=2; x++) {\n            for(let y=-2; y<=2; y++) {\n                for(let z=-2; z<=2; z++) {\n                    const dist = Math.abs(x) + Math.abs(y) + Math.abs(z);\n                    if (dist <= 3 && Math.random() > 0.4) {\n\n                        const blockGroup = new THREE.Group();\n                        blockGroup.position.set(x * 1.3, y * 1.3, z * 1.3);\n\n                        const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, lineMaterial);\n                        blockGroup.add(line);\n\n                        const rand = Math.random();\n                        if(rand > 0.85) {\n                            const solidMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, accentMaterial1);\n                            solidMesh.scale.set(0.99, 0.99, 0.99);\n                            blockGroup.add(solidMesh);\n                        } else if (rand > 0.75) {\n                            const solidMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, accentMaterial2);\n                            solidMesh.scale.set(0.99, 0.99, 0.99);\n                            blockGroup.add(solidMesh);\n                        }\n\n                        group.add(blockGroup);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        const axisGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([\n            new THREE.Vector3(-15, 0, 0), new THREE.Vector3(15, 0, 0),\n            new THREE.Vector3(0, -15, 0), new THREE.Vector3(0, 15, 0),\n            new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, -15), new THREE.Vector3(0, 0, 15)\n        ]);\n        const axisMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x000000, opacity: 0.1, transparent: true });\n        const axisLines = new THREE.LineSegments(axisGeo, axisMat);\n        group.add(axisLines);\n\n        scene.add(group);\n\n        let frame = 0;\n        let targetRotationX = 0;\n        let targetRotationY = 0;\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        let windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            // Further reduced mouse influence for subtle effect\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.00015;\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.00015;\n        });\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Subdued continuous drift\n            group.rotation.y += 0.0002;\n\n            // Smoother, lesser parallax easing\n            targetRotationY += (mouseX - targetRotationY) * 0.02;\n            targetRotationX += (mouseY - targetRotationX) * 0.02;\n\n            group.rotation.y += targetRotationY;\n            group.rotation.x += targetRotationX;\n\n            // Vastly reduced float distance and speed\n            group.position.y = Math.sin(frame * 0.005) * 0.08;\n\n            frame++;\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            if(!container) return;\n            const width = container.clientWidth;\n            const height = container.clientHeight;\n            const newAspect = width / height;\n\n            windowHalfX = width / 2;\n            windowHalfY = height / 2;\n\n            camera.left = -d * newAspect;\n            camera.right = d * newAspect;\n            camera.top = d;\n            camera.bottom = -d;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n            renderer.setSize(width, height);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "omnigrid-framework.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/omnigrid-framework.jpg", "source_name": "omnigrid-framework-DESIGN.md", "views": 123, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:58:08.731674+00:00"}